OL,3,GNEWSAProtected zone could grow to help
OL,4,Alobster stocks
OL,5,
OL,6,FJersey could expand a protected fishing
OL,7,Fzone around Les Ecrehous in a bid to
OL,8,Freverse declining lobster catches.
OL,10,FProposals lodged by Environment
OL,11,FMinister Mary Le Hegarat would increase
OL,12,Fthe size of the existing zone, about
OL,13,Fsix miles (10km) north-east of Jersey,
OL,14,Fwhere "highly effective" parlour pots
OL,15,Fare banned from use.
OL,17,FUnlike a traditional "inkwell" pot,
OL,18,Fwhich usually has a single chamber, a
OL,19,Fparlour pot contains two or more
OL,20,Fcompartments.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
