OL,3,GNEWSAProtected zone could grow to help
OL,4,Alobster stocks
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe move comes as Jersey's lobster
OL,7,Ffishery faces mounting pressure, with
OL,8,Fcommercial lobster landings declining
OL,9,Fsteadily since 2015.
